Risks if left as-is:
- Agents will follow `ww-scaffold-view`/`ww-build-game` and reintroduce window-type drift (missing `window_type_registry.cpp`, schemas)
- “Green build” claims may ignore parity because docs disagree on when parity runs
- Contributors lose confidence because parity gate command currently errors before collection
- Param name drift (`id`/`win_id`/`window_id`) will keep escaping unless command-specific tests happen to exist

