- Doc lint: fail CI if docs mention nonexistent `tools/api_server/mcp_tools.py` unless file exists
- Skill lint: any skill mentioning “new window/view/command” or “build/test” must include parity gate or link to `CLAUDE.md` Parity Law
- Parity workflow smoke: run the exact Parity Law command in CI and assert no import/collection errors
- Schema/param contract tests for representative commands (at least one per naming style) and typed REST routes
- Optional stronger test: parse command registry param hints + route schemas and assert mapped endpoint arg names match (where applicable)

